|-
| <code>FWI_Fruit_Juice_Icon</code>   || Fruit Juice   || Looted from containers and zombie corpses
|-
| <code>FWI_Soda_Icon</code>          || Soda          || Looted from containers and zombie corpses
|-
| <code>FWI_Energy_Drink_Icon</code>  || Energy Drink  || Looted from containers and zombie corpses
